# Check every text file out with LF on every platform.
#
# Prettier is configured with `endOfLine: "lf"`, so under Git's default
# core.autocrlf=true on Windows the sources would check out with CRLF and
# `prettier --check` would fail on an untouched clone. Normalizing here keeps
# the working tree byte-identical on macOS, Linux and Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets Git must never rewrite.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
